# Copy this file to .env and fill in the value. .env is git-ignored; never commit it.
#
# SA password for the local SQL Server container (docker-compose.yml).
# SQL Server's password policy: at least 8 characters, with characters from at
# least three of these four sets: uppercase, lowercase, digits, symbols. A
# password that fails the policy makes the container exit on first start.
#
# SQL Server applies this value only when it creates the data volume. To change
# the password later, recreate the volume: `docker compose down -v`, then
# `docker compose up -d`. That deletes the local database; re-run the migrations.
# The app reads the same password from the ConnectionStrings:EnvanexDb user-secret;
# keep the two in sync.
MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD=
